{"id": "1823796", "name": "מציאת וקטור בגרעין ושאינו בתמונה במטריצות 2X2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "random_invertible_matrix", "params": ["n"], "body": "genmatrix (LowerWithDiag, n, n).transpose(genmatrix (LowerWithDiag, n, n))"}, {"name": "colToMatrix", "params": ["cl", "m", "n"], "body": "apply(matrix, makelist(makelist(cl[i+n*(j-1),1],i,1,n),j,1,m ))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהיינה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A_1={{CT:0}},\\quad A_2={{CT:1}},\\quad A_3={{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>ונגדיר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V=\\text{span}\\{A_1,A_2,A_3\\}\\)</span>.</p><p>נתונה העתקה לינארית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T:V\\to M_2(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span> המקיימת:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ T (A_1) =T (A_2) = {{CT:3}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ T (A_3) = {{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> שונה ממטריצת האפס הנמצאת בגרעין <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ker T\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>מצאו מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span> <b>שאיננה</b> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(ImT\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(C=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "matToCol(mat):= transpose(flatten(args(mat)));\n\nflag1: zeromatrixp(ans1);\nflag2: is(rank(addcol(v1-v2,matToCol(ans1)))=1);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "flag1", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "flag2", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> יפה מאוד!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "matToCol(mat):= transpose(flatten(args(mat)));\n\nflag: if rank(addcol(w1,w2,matToCol(ans2)))=3 then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> נכון מאוד!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך איננה נכונה. המטריצה שנתת נמצאת בתמונה של T.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["LowerWithDiag", "base_mat", "output_trans_mat", "v1", "v2", "v3", "v4", "w1", "w2", "w3", "w4"], "nvariants": 50}